
---

## ⚙️ `.gitignore` (main root)

```gitignore
# Node modules
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
backend/node_modules/

# Environment files
.env
.env.local

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Build directories
frontend/build/
backend/dist/
dist/
build/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE specific
.vscode/
.idea/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.swp

# Coverage / Testing
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# Misc
*.bak
